<p>Your mutations have enhanced your offense even farther.</p><p>You gain <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">19, 24, 29, 32, 35</acronym> Accuracy and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">19, 24, 29, 32, 35</acronym> Spellpower.</p><p>The effects will increase with your Magic stat.</p>